<title>USA: Philipsburg Area SD, Pa., adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>Philipsburg Area SD, Pa., adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philipsburg-Osceola Area School District, Pa.,  said it recalculated PNC Securities Corp's winning bid for the District's $7 million bond issue.  The interest cost is now an NIC of 5.38174 percent, reflecting the cost of bonds insurance, not the TIC of 5.35 percent originally calculated.</p>
